From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:14:29 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] hyperion.ng: build without the DRM and framebuffer grabbers

Kodi feeds Hyperion the GUI and the video. When selected, the DRM
grabber reads the GUI buffer from uncached memory at a large CPU cost
and takes DRM master before Kodi at boot. The framebuffer grabber shows
only the boot splash.
---
 .../packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/changelog.txt          | 1 +
 .../Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/package.mk  | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/changelog.txt b/projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/changelog.txt
--- a/projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/changelog.txt
+++ b/projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/changelog.txt
@@ -0,6 +0,7 @@
 - Remove Amlogic grabber
 - Drop platform script
 - Feed the Kodi picture, video and menus, to Hyperion by itself over hyperiond's flatbuffer server, on by default (screen capture used to be opt-in)
+- Build without the DRM and framebuffer screen grabbers
 122
 - Add platform script
 121
diff --git a/projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/package.mk b/projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/package.mk
--- a/projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/package.mk
+++ b/projects/Amlogic-ce/packages/addons/service/hyperion.ng/package.mk
@@ -0,7 +0,8 @@
                          -DENABLE_AMLOGIC=OFF \
                          -DENABLE_DISPMANX=OFF \
                          -DENABLE_CEC=OFF \
-                         -DENABLE_FB=ON \
+                         -DENABLE_FB=OFF \
+                         -DENABLE_DRM=OFF \
                          -DENABLE_DEV_WS281XPWM=OFF \
                          -DENABLE_X11=OFF \
                          -DENABLE_V4L2=ON \
